== progress
progressT idT                            left [refused (progressT)]  log []
labProgressT idT                         left [refused (failWithT)]  log []
progressT (relabel)                      left [refused (progressT)]  log []
labProgressT (relabel)                   left [wf]  log []
progressT (cut: two subgoals)            left [assertion main]  log []
labProgressT (cut: two subgoals)         left [assertion main]  log []
progressT (fail)                         left [refused (failWithT)]  log []
labProgressT (fail)                      left [refused (failWithT)]  log []
== repetition
untilFailT count (3)                     left [n0]  log [count@main; count@n2; count@n1; count:fail]
untilFailT count (0)                     left [main]  log [count:fail]
whileT (goal is C) count (3)             left [main]  log [count@main]
whileT (goal is D) count (3)             left [main]  log []
untilT (goal is C) count (3)             left [main]  log []
whileT (goal is C) idT                   left [main]  log [w@main:C]
== conditionals
ifT (label main) a b                     left [main]  log [a@main:C]
ifT (label wf) a b                       left [main]  log [b@main:C]
ifOnHypT (is A) yes no 1                 left [main]  log [yes1@main:>-C]
ifOnHypT (is A) yes no 2                 left [main]  log [no2@main:>-C]
ifThenOnHypT (is A) yes 3                left [main]  log [yes3@main:>-C]
ifThenOnHypT (is A) yes 2                left [refused (failWithT)]  log []
== labels
keepingLabelT (relabel wf)               left [main]  log []
keepingLabelT fan                        left [main main main main]  log []
fan thenT ifAT rec                       left [wf equality assertion main]  log [a@wf:W; a@equality:E; a@assertion:P]
== same conclusion
seqOnSameConclT [] (goal C)              left [main]  log []
seqOnSameConclT [fan; a] (goal C)        left [refused (Term_man_ds.concl)]  log []
seqOnSameConclT [cut; a; b]              left [assertion main]  log [a@main:>-C; b@main:>-C]
seqOnSameConclT [cut; cut; a]            left [assertion assertion main]  log [a@main:>-C]
seqOnSameConclT [relabel; a]             left [wf]  log [a@wf:>-C]
seqOnSameConclT [idT; idT; a]            left [main]  log [a@main:>-C]
then_OnSameConclT cut a                  left [assertion main]  log [a@main:>-C]
== hypotheses
onAnyHypT (works on 2)                   left [main]  log [h3; h2]
onAnyHypT (works on none)                left [main]  log [h3; h2; h1]
onSomeHypT (works on none)               left [refused (failWithT)]  log [h3; h2; h1]
onAnyHypT (no hypotheses)                left [main]  log []
onAllMClausesOfAssumT 1                  left [main]  log [c1.2@:C; c1.1@:C; c1.0@:C]
onAllMClausesOfAssumT 2                  left [main]  log [c2.1@:C; c2.0@:C]
onAllMClausesOfAssumT 1 (one assum)      left [main]  log [c1.2@:C; c1.1@:C; c1.0@:C]
onAllMClausesOfAssumT 2 (three)          left [main]  log [c2.1@:C; c2.0@:C]
